n her teens  if you have a lot of siblings you've  probably had at least one of them go  through this same phase as Lucy her  alternate boy version is called Lars  loud and he's just as snarky and moody  unlike Lucy Lars is slightly more  aggressive and doesn't get along with  Lincoln Jay boy 32x from deviantART also  created an interesting version of Lucy  as a boy and check this out he also  showed what Lucy and Lars would look  like as a couple  it's a strange thought considering  they're basically the same person but  for some reason this illustration is  really cute if you've ever wondered  where the creativity behind the loud  house characters came from look no  further than the  Gators family Chris savino's family  shares many of the names with the loud  house characters two sisters are even  named after his family's wiener dogs  will tell you more about that later  however Lucy's name is a baby named  Chris would have picked if he had a baby  girl how cute is that speaking of cute  we can't decide who we like better Lucy  or Lars  Lenny loud next on our list is Lenny  loud the 16 year old Lenny is  overprotective loving and somewhat ditzy  but we still love her  as the second oldest in the loud family  she is known to show a lot of love to  her younger siblings in an alternate  universe a boy version of Lenny is named  Lonnie the two share similar  characteristics but Lonnie isn't such a  family person and he doesn't really care  what happens to his younger siblings as  Lenny is a typical girly girl this  transition is pretty interesting check  out the official version of Lonnie it  seems that he replaced Lenny's round  shades for slightly cooler looking  sunglasses and he's totally rocking them  here are a couple more versions of the  character created by a deviantART user  AAAS Russia Lonnie is definitely looking  sassier than Lenny here's another  adorable example of what Lonnie loud  would look like this cute illustration  belongs to at large loud smells good on  Instagram Lonnie definitely still has  Lenny's ditzy and naive characteristics  but what he doesn't have is the love for  his siblings did you know that the loud  house characters were originally  imagined as rabbits Lenny's name didn't  come from Chris savino's family it was a  named Chris gave one of the rabbit  characters and it was originally a boy  named based on the character in Of Mice  and Men Chris then changed the spelling  and turned it into a woman's name Lowell  allowed this six-year-old pageant queen  is one of those siblings that's bound to  get on everyone's nerves like a true  princess Lola is bossy and bratty but  her antics are also totally hilarious  it's hard to imagine what this girly  girl would look like as a typical boy  right  well when the loud house reimagined all  loud sisters as boys they decided to  call Lola Lex Lex is completely  different from this pageant queen  although he's still a prince and he's  totally spoiled lexis also mean to  everyone including Lincoln check him out  sure he has a crown on his head  but unlike Lola Lex isn't sporting a  long pink dress a deviantART user Ian  Kyle 1189 also drew what Lola and Lex  would look like as separate people we  can't decide which one we prefer the  spoiled but funny Lola or the spoiled  but me and Lex we've previously  mentioned that Lola loud has a lot in  common with honey boo boo they're both  pageant queens but  don't you think they also kind of look  alike and yes Lolo is actually named  after Chris savino's wiener dog it looks  like Chris really did manage to turn his  life into an actual cartoon although we  doubt Lola or her male version have any  qualities that are similar to dogs at  least we hope they don't we can't  mention Lola without also talking about  her tomboy twin Lana the two are already  alternate versions of themselves but  Lana also has a male version and his  name is leaf leaf and Lana are quite  similar and shared the same  personalities however leaf is slightly  more aggressive and mean especially  towards Lincoln fans have also created  their own versions of leaf loud  including this one which belongs to  Lewis Olazabal leaf and Lex loud are  posing together and they both look like  they're up to no good  we were always fans of Lana's tomboyish  look and leaf is still rocking that red  snapback we also love this illustration  of leaf loud done by a deviantART user  named the total kid just like Lana leaf  is missing some of his front teeth and  rocking those denim overalls  although Lola was named by a wiener dog  Lana was fortunate enough to be named by  one of Chris savino's sisters did you  know that a lot of the shenanigans  actually come from Chris's real life  experiences he claims that his siblings  have enough sense of humor to never get  upset over what they see on the show  however Lana loud has so many crazy  moments it makes us wonder what the real  Lana was like as a child  Lorie loud as the oldest of the eleven  siblings everyone expects Laurie to be  the overprotective and loving big sister  well while Laurie does have her  overprotective moments she also always  makes sure she lets her siblings know  who's the oldest if you have an older  sibling we're pretty sure you know what  it's like to be constantly told you're  younger than they are  Laurie establishes dominance and treats  her siblings like they're her personal  helpers but her personality still isn't  as mean as her boy version which is  called Loki when Lincoln wished to have  brothers instead of sisters we bet he  never really wished for Loki Loki is  bossy but his looks aren't that much  different from Laurie's check out the  official Loki designed by the loud house  creators we all know Laurie as a total  flirt and Loki is the same deviant arts  Makiki em are also Illustrated a  fantastic version of Loki accidentally  dropping his phone and this talented  deviantART user named Brandon Vance  showed us what Loki and Laurie would  look like if they ever got married  Laurie is also the name of one of Chris  savino sisters but Chris did note that  their namesakes don't match their  personas it's good to know Chris's older  sister was probably nicer than Laurie  Lisa loud Lisa  is probably one of our favorite  characters on the show she was  responsible for bringing together the  world at the loud house with The Fairly  OddParents her clever mind is on a whole  other level which is probably why she  won a Nobel Peace Prize at just four  years old she's pretty incredible right  well wait until you see her alternate  male version Lisa in a boy version is  called Levi Levi is just as talented as  Lisa but he tends to be a bit harsher  and aggressive especially toward Lincoln  Levi has short hair but the rest of him  is pretty similar to Lisa however we  think that Levi also looks like another  popular cartoon character can you see  the resemblance between Levi loud and  dexter from dexters laboratory the two  could basically be the same characters  the loud house fan on deviantART also  created an amazing version of Levi and  replaced his round glasses with slightly  cooler looking shades Makiki mr also  drew his own version of Levi this one is  a bit taller and we can definitely see  that he looks like Dexter could you cope  with having a four year old sister who's  as smart as Lisa we can't decide if we  prefer Lisa or Levi loud but we're sure  that if they both existed in the same  universe they'd come up with some  amazing experiments Lynne loud the 13  year old Lynne is one of the most  athletic and sporty characters on the  show but when you have so many siblings  you usually turn things into a  competition Lynne is super competitive  and likes to win at all times if you  have siblings you probably have at least  one competitive sibling that does this -  Lynne is the only character on the show  that got the same name when she became a  boy the male Lynne lad has a similar  personality same clothing and just  slightly shorter hair he's just as  competitive and maybe just a bit more  abrasive especially towards Lincoln we  wonder why Chris Tavano decided to leave  his name the same speaking of Chris did  you know that his family loves that  they're now part of such a big show he  said he's always getting text messages  whenever someone watches an episode but  the inspiration didn't just come from  Chris's family the show's writers also  frequently discuss things they used to  do as children and then use it in the  show Lynne is also the name of one of  his sisters but unlike her cartoon  version we hope that the real win cut  some slack to other non-competitive  siblings on the other hand no sibling  relationship is complete without a bit  of rivalry right loon allowed the loud  house has so many interesting characters  it's very hard to pick your favorite  Luna is also one of those people that  stand out from the crowd and her  insanely large family this 15 year old  loves rock music and you'll catch her  singing popular rock song throughout the  show and although she's loud and  sometimes wild whoo  one of the most caring out of all the  siblings her looks are unique and she  can rock a purple outfit like nobody  else you can't help but love Lunas  attitude her alternate male version is  called Luke and although he looks the  same his attitude is slightly more  aggressive honestly we're glad Lincoln  has 10 sisters instead of 10 brothers  Michael Eddie drew another version of  Luke and even paired him up with Layne  loud louann's boy version speaking of  Luke loud did you know that he's played  by Greg Cipes who's an actual musician  you might remember his voice from  Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles where he  played Michelangelo Luna is always  singing rock song but imagine if Luke  loud would be there to sing the lower  range songs with her the two could  create the ultimate rock band and we'd  be the first ones to buy their album and  we have a feeling they would title their  album after their last name seems  fitting right Lincoln loud if you've  watched the one of the boys episode of  this show you'll know that Lincoln is  the one responsible for turning his  sisters into boys as the only boy of the  family Lincoln has a lot on his plate  and we really feel bad for him because  it's definitely not easy but what would  happen if Lincoln wasn't actually a boy  in the first place check him out this  illustration is done by karela deville  84 and it's absolutely fabulous a female  version of Lincoln has longer hair a  blue skirt and orange blouse and  earrings in the official loud house  episode Lincoln's name as a girl is  linka did you know that Lincoln is  actually the only character with more  than four letters in his name when the  characters were first created they were  rabbit which is why Lincoln is also the  only one that was left with unique white  hair we haven't seen much of the girl  version of linka but Dan McEwan on  deviantART also gave us a good idea of  what Lincoln would look like as a bonus  check out a female version of Lincoln's  best friend Clyde called Claire McBride  after that episode were pretty sure  Lincoln stopped wishing for brothers and  started to enjoy the crazy life with his  10 sisters what about you do you wish  you could have a sister or a brother if  you love the loud house don't forget to  check out videos like 10 the loud house  characters in real life don't forget to  subscribe and hit that thumbs up button  see you next time  [Music]

